url: "https://marcofly.app/contribute-time"
abstract: >
  Community-driven validation of the MarcoFLY Framework (MFF-EX), a prompt
  engineering protocol based on epistemic labels and anti-circularity.
  Preregistered crowdsourced human evaluation testing 5 hypotheses
  (hallucination reduction, label calibration, no regression, language-agnostic,
  model-agnostic) across multiple AI providers in IT and EN.
keywords:
  - prompt-engineering
  - llm-evaluation
  - open-science
  - crowdsourced-validation
  - epistemic-labels
  - mff-ex
  - mff-framework
  - hallucination
  - calibration
